                                "sense_id": "b8a070b7-ac2a-3225-a55b-16c1b4699a3a",
                                "text": "A pseudohermaphroditic infant female rhesus monkey (Macaca mulatta) showing masculinization of the external genitalia as a result of exposure to testosterone propionate during foetal development."
